# Issue #43: --zero-pack-lines against the baseline (config_issue43_zero_lines.json).
# B3 has two speeds (#36): at the model's nc (384) and at the shipped nc=128 (override on the
# B3_nc128 label). B3_K256 is its slowest form (#34); B2 and Reuse24 are one-speed controls.
# layer     M     N     K
B3          64    384   384
B3_nc128    64    384   384
B3_K256     64    384   256
B2          384   384   64
R24         384   384   384
